stormnic-mlx4
=============

The code in this repository is licensed under the MIT licence (Cargo.toml).

docs/spec/connectx3.md describes register layouts, command and mailbox
layouts, field offsets and bit widths, opcodes, constants and command
sequences for the Mellanox/NVIDIA ConnectX-3 and ConnectX-3 Pro adapters.
Those layouts are derived from the following sources, used under the
OpenIB.org BSD licence option of their dual GPL-2 / BSD licensing:

  - Linux: drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx4/ and include/linux/mlx4/
    (torvalds/linux, commit 6f8319e3e9a44dd537d17f41565a8453c560a581)
  - FreeBSD: sys/dev/mlx4/
    (freebsd/freebsd-src, commit 669cd0d90ee7b5bed794ded5fa00b6be854a6598)

